SMART LEARN – Hero Video Prompt (Refined)
Objective
Create a premium 25–28 second cinematic hero video for Smart Learn, an intelligent AI-powered Learning Platform.
The video sits directly below the website header and must capture attention in the first 3 seconds, creating curiosity and the desire to explore further.
Tone: Apple product launch / Stripe commercial / Microsoft Fluent — minimal, elegant, futuristic, trustworthy, and premium.
Brand Feel
Innovation • Intelligence • Simplicity • Trust • Future of Learning
Target: universities, schools, corporate training, healthcare, government, professional training providers.

Scene 1 — The Hook (0–3.5s)
Black screen.
A soft glowing cursor blinks once.
Elegant white typography fades in, perfectly centered:
Learning is Changing.
Brief hold.
Text dissolves into fine streams of electric-blue and cyan light particles.
Camera surges forward through the particles into a luminous digital space.
Scene 2 — The Platform (3.5–8s)
Seamless fly-through of a stunning, ultra-clean learning dashboard.
Glassmorphic panels with soft depth, realistic reflections, and subtle purple-blue gradients.
Camera glides past:

Live course cards with gentle hover states
A student progress ring filling with soft cyan light
An elegant AI assistant panel (no robot — only flowing light and clean text)
Real-time analytics sparklines
Certificate thumbnail with subtle paper-like texture
Floating interface elements drift with perfect smoothness.
No on-screen text in this scene — let the UI speak.

Scene 3 — Create Effortlessly (8–13s)
An instructor’s hand (or clean cursor) adds a simple text block.
Instantly, elegant AI light traces transform it into:

Beautifully formatted lesson
Interactive quiz cards that gently unfold
Learning path nodes connecting with soft glowing lines
Multimedia activity tiles
Everything feels effortless and magical.
Single clean text appears at the bottom third:
Create Exceptional Learning Experiences
Then fades, replaced by:
Faster Than Ever

Scene 4 — Silent Intelligence (13–18s)
Transition into pure AI visualization — flowing data streams, elegant light ribbons, and soft particle systems.
No robots.
Subtle visual metaphors:

Assignment cards being analyzed with gentle scanning light
Instant feedback appearing as soft glowing annotations
Personalized recommendation paths branching organically
At-risk indicators softly highlighted then resolved
Text fades in cleanly:
Powered by Artificial Intelligence

Scene 5 — Anywhere, Smarter (18–23s)
Seamless device morphing:
Desktop → laptop → tablet → smartphone, all showing the same live session.
Learners watching a lesson, completing a quiz, progress bars filling, achievement badge gently appearing.
Collaboration cursor and soft notification pulse.
Text sequence (spaced, elegant):
Learn Anywhere
Learn Faster
Learn Smarter
Scene 6 — Built for Organizations + Close (23–28s)
Quick, cinematic dissolves through environments: modern corporate office, university lecture hall, healthcare training room, government training center.
Analytics dashboard expands, showing organization-wide growth curves and completion metrics with soft cyan highlights.
Return to the Smart Learn homepage interface, which glows with refined light.
Camera slowly pulls back.
Premium typography:
SMART LEARN
The Intelligent Learning Platform
Then three words appear one after another:
Learn. Build. Grow.
A glowing, elegant CTA button fades in:
Start Your Learning Journey
Everything holds for a beat, then fades to black.

Visual Style

Apple Keynote / Stripe / Microsoft Fluent Design
Glassmorphism, soft gradients, realistic reflections
Deep navy, electric blue, cyan, soft purple accents
Floating UI elements, cinematic depth of field
Ultra-clean compositions, zero clutter
High-end SaaS commercial lighting

Camera
Cinematic fly-throughs, slow dolly, elegant zooms, orbiting interface shots.
Only smooth, premium motion. No shaky cam, no hard cuts.
Music
Subtle atmospheric electronic start → gradual inspirational build → clean, uplifting crescendo (think refined tech-brand score, never aggressive).
Hard Constraints

Never show or mention Moodle, LMS, or any competitor names
No robots or cliché AI imagery
Minimal, highly legible typography
Every frame must feel like a premium technology commercial
Viewer should leave thinking: “This is the future of learning. I want to explore Smart Learn.” 
